   "widgets_values": [
    "Genre: warm acoustic folk-pop. Mood: innocent, playful, storybook-gentle energy. Tempo: easy 96 BPM sway. Vocals: soft female lead in English, close and breathy. Instruments: fingerpicked acoustic guitar, soft piano, light hand percussion. Arrangement: sparse intro, verses that gently bloom. Production: warm, intimate, roomy. For a cozy storytime playlist.",
    "[verse]\nMary had a little lamb\nIts fleece was white as snow\nAnd everywhere that Mary went\nThe lamb was sure to go\n[verse]\nIt followed her to school one day\nWhich was against the rule\nIt made the children laugh and play\nTo see a lamb at school",
